            "body": "## Code Review\n\nThe pull request modifies the `_replace_name` method in `MegatronModelMerger` to correctly convert parameter names for Qwen3 MoE models. The changes involve adding a nested function to handle the name conversion logic for MoE layers. I suggested removing the nested function and placing its logic directly within the `_replace_name` function to reduce unnecessary indentation and improve readability.",
